  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nDockerfile is missing lxml\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nTurn on `url_preview_enabled`\r\n\r\n```\r\nMissing lxml library. This is required for URL preview API.\r\n    Install by running:\r\n        pip install lxml\r\n    Requires libxslt1-dev system package.\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\nmatrixdotorg/synapse:v0.29.0",
